# Unit Approve grounding (every project)

SoT = **`index.db` + TC text** (Module → Function → Title). Portable mọi stack. Không hardcode domain sản phẩm.

> **Pha Approve only.** Sinh Unit TC → [`unit-tc-from-analysis.mdc`](unit-tc-from-analysis.mdc).  
> Chi tiết as-built + roadmap: [`docs/UNIT_APPROVE_SOURCE_GROUNDING.md`](../../docs/UNIT_APPROVE_SOURCE_GROUNDING.md).

## Progressive match

```
Module → Function → Title → index.db → CRUD verb → *Handler/*Service → path:/code: → sync MD
```

| Step | Input | Effect |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | **Module** (Requirement Studio) | Lock source-module family (fail-closed / feature-folder discover) |
| 2 | **Function** (`tc.module`) | Rank files trong family |
| 3 | **Title** + steps/expected | Refine symbol; khớp **CRUD verb** |
| 4 | Body-rule (optional) | Confirm excerpt; same-family tie ≠ ambiguous |

Sync MD: `requirement:` = Module; `function:` / `module:` = Function.  
Markers: `path:` + `code:` (Type hoặc Type.Method) + optional `related:` + companion `.grounding.json` (Layer 5). Comment có `confidence=`; fail `FAIL_VALIDATE` / `STALE_INDEX`.

## CRUD verb (VI/IT → path stems)

Từ Function + Title + steps + `quan sát:` — **không** từ «từ chối» / trùng mã alone.

| Verb | Cues | Path stems |
| --- | --- | --- |
| create | tạo mới, create, add new | Create / Insert / Add |
| read | tải/lấy chi tiết, get by id, quan sát: read | Get / Query / FindById |
| update | cập nhật, update, edit, quan sát: update | Update / Edit / Patch |
| delete | xóa, delete, remove, quan sát: delete | Delete / Remove |

Wrong CRUD sibling → refuse soft writeBack. `validate_reject` ≠ create shape.

## Resolver (as-built)

1. `index.db` deterministic  
2. Optional FS excerpt (body-rule)  
3. LLM shortlist fallback — chỉ khi fail-closed / ungated  

Không invent product nouns để vá path sai.

## Forbidden

- Product nouns trong protocol / shared aliases  
- Absolute `D:/...` paths  
- Agent tự điền SUT knobs để vá ranking  
- Sửa sync-MD rules theo dự án thay vì Approve ranking  
- Ghi docs/roadmap như đã ship khi chưa có code

## After changes

Restart Desktop → Re-Approve → MD có `path:` / `code:` (+ optional `.grounding.json`).
